00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:22.090
- Yeah. I'm very sure my
forties will be cooler

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:22.923
than my thirties.

00:00:22.923 --> 00:00:24.464
- Yeah, it keeps getting better.

00:00:24.464 --> 00:00:26.547
(laughs)

00:00:28.481 --> 00:00:29.560
