guess, like stepping into that.

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:55.970
So we'll see.

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:58.050
I think music will be more fun

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.280
to just like trying new things. So.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:02.780
